{"unit_id":"zingzheng__dsh-gb#card-zh","repo":"zingzheng/dsh-gb","commit":"22e62edaa1b340ad7ed4c4c57804a5111a2314f2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gb 是 DSH 网页客户端的手机掌机插件，通过扫码把手机连接为语音遥控器和状态屏。Host 侧启动局域网 HTTP 服务，GUI 侧加入掌机设置页和会话桥接，并用手机界面发送消息、浏览会话内容、暂停 agent、响应审批和选择题；屏幕展示运行状态与摘要，方向键可切换消息或选择答案。用户可在同一局域网直连，也可选用快速或命名 Cloudflare 隧道进行远程连接。适合需要离开电脑时查看并操作 DSH 会话的人；安装 DSH Web 插件后无需 API key，公网隧道功能首次启用会下载 cloudflared。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:133-165","lib/server-core.js:419-455","lib/client-src.js:677-714","lib/tunnel.js:123-140"]}
{"unit_id":"zingzheng__dsh-gb#card-en","repo":"zingzheng/dsh-gb","commit":"22e62edaa1b340ad7ed4c4c57804a5111a2314f2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-gb makes a phone a remote for the DSH web client. Its phone page connects by QR over a LAN or optional Cloudflare tunnel. Users can send messages, browse sessions, pause agents, answer approvals and questions, and view session status. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:133-165","lib/server-core.js:419-455","lib/client-src.js:677-714","lib/tunnel.js:123-140"]}
